# Keep the build context small and, importantly, keep locally-generated
# artifacts out of the images. A classifier.joblib trained on the host with a
# different scikit-learn version must NOT be baked in — the image trains its own
# (matching-version) model via `make eval`, and otherwise falls back to the
# similarity threshold.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.git/
.github/
.venv/
.venv-test/
venv/
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
*.log

# Trained model artifacts (regenerated inside the container by `make eval`)
eval/classifier.joblib
agent-service/app/eval/classifier.joblib

# Private notes — never ship in an image
EXPLANATION.md
